    "sections": {
        "description": "Courier Company is a clean and practical website theme designed for logistics providers, courier services, and shipping businesses that need a clear and professional online presence. The layout is structured to present services, delivery information, pricing details, and contact options in an easy-to-navigate format, helping visitors quickly find what they need. Customizable homepage sections allow businesses to highlight key services and updates without technical complexity. The theme is built for speed and smooth performance, ensuring a reliable browsing experience across devices. Its organized design keeps information clear while maintaining a professional visual style suited for modern logistics brands. Courier Company also supports integrations such as booking forms, tracking features, ecommerce tools, and multilingual functionality, making it adaptable for growing businesses. Whether used by startups or established delivery companies, the theme focuses on usability, clarity, and flexibility helping service-based businesses communicate efficiently and convert visitors into customers."
    },
